  "description": "Mark Vassilevskiy is a 19-year-old from Kazakhstan who built a $1M design agency in just 10 months. He went from zero clients to $80K/month revenue by mastering a strategy nobody else uses: public free redesigns. This video breaks down his \"free work” formula and how he turned rejection into a repeatable client acquisition system.\n\nGet design inspiration from the world's best apps → https://go.starterstory.com/markv\n\nBuild your own AI app→ https://build.starterstory.com/build/ai-build-accelerator?utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=markv\n\nMark's $1M business: https://skale.solutions/\nFollow Mark: https://x.com/markknd\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild  \n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\n0:00 - Intro\n0:54 - Who is Mark\n1:09 - What does Skale do?\n1:40 - Mark's background\n2:33 - Landing the first big client\n3:28 - Free work that led to clients\n4:08 - How to build an audience\n7:06 - Numbers behind Skale\n7:37 - $1M Tech stack\n8:10 - Tools to get started\n8:32 - Volume negates luck\n9:21 - The final word\n\nThis video is an educational case study of one founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.",
